{"ref":"BDB, כּ֫וֹרֶשׁ","hw":"כּ֫וֹרֶשׁ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">כּ֫וֹרֶשׁ</span></big>  and (<a data-ref=\"Ezra 1:1\" href=\"/Ezra.1.1\">Ezr 1:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 1:2\" href=\"/Ezra.1.2\">2</a>) <span dir=\"rtl\">כֹּ֫רֶשׁ</span> <strong>n.pr.m. Cyrus (</strong>Pers. <em>Kʾurʾu</em>, Spieg<sup>APK 215</sup>; Bab. <em>Kuraš</em> COT on <a data-ref=\"Ezra 1:1\" href=\"/Ezra.1.1\">Ezr 1:1</a>, Dl in Baer <sup>Dn. p. x</sup><strong>)</strong>—king of (Anzan = Susiana, Tiele<sup> Bab.-Assyr. Gesch. 469</sup>, and) Persia, conqueror of Babylon (Tiele <sup>ib; 468 ff.</sup>), restorer of Jews to Palestine <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:28\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.28\">Is 44:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 45:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.45.1\">45:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 1:7\" href=\"/Ezra.1.7\">Ezr 1:7</a>; called <span dir=\"rtl\">מֶלֶךְ פָּרַס</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 36:22\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.36.22\">2 Ch 36:22</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 36:23\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.36.23\">23</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 1:1\" href=\"/Ezra.1.1\">Ezr 1:1</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 1:2\" href=\"/Ezra.1.2\">2</a> also <a data-ref=\"Ezra 1:8\" href=\"/Ezra.1.8\">Ezr 1:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:3\" href=\"/Ezra.4.3\">4:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:5\" href=\"/Ezra.4.5\">5</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 10:1\" href=\"/Daniel.10.1\">Dn 10:1</a>; simply <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמֶּלֶךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:21\" href=\"/Daniel.1.21\">Dn 1:21</a>.","next":"BDB, כּוּשׁ","prev":"BDB, מְכֵרָה"}